<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―That night, I had a dream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "3000"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\優しい言葉で低い.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "111.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "200" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\幻想的な桜土手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "20" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The embankment in front of the hospital, where cherry blossoms bloom in full glory as far as I can see.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A wind blowing through. A very pleasant wind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I breathe in the breath of spring as deeply as I can and fill my body with it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then,<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpaaai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Aha, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Gotooo</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the distance, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> is waving.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wave back at <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "11" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"It's spring already! Everyone's all excited. It's a fun season!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're right! The cherry blossoms are really pretty too. I love this season!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"This season, when the cherry blossoms bloom, really is the best, isn't it!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I like summer and fall and winter too, but I like spring best. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, here she comes!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "11" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry, sorry! Kept you waiting!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're so late, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! What were you doing all this time?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, no, I just overslept, that's all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "11" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Just overslept? Oversleeping is exactly what's wrong!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "11" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ha ha ha, forgive me. I just woke up for the first time in 2 years, and my whole body's sluggish..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you'd been asleep for 2 years already..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "11" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, now that the three of us are finally together, let's hurry up and go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Go? Where?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What're you talking about? There's that view </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> always wanted to see, isn't there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... what was it..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "11" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are you half-asleep too?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Wasn't it you who said you wanted to see a new world, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah, come to think of it, that's right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But where is that world?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "11" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> exchange a look, and then the two of them burst out laughing together.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "11" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> big idiot! Look, it's right here!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\光.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\幻想的な桜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "12" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Before my eyes, cherry blossoms in riotous bloom as far as I can see.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A spring storm blowing through them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Blown by that storm, a blizzard of cherry petals whirling down.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's beautiful...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I'm so happy I could come to a new world with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! I have something I want to do with you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="2">I want us to take a photo together!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="2">Because we're―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
But <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>, who should have been right beside me a moment ago, is nowhere to be seen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no sign of <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where did they both go?<PG>
In this place that was so lively a moment ago, only the spring storm rages.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I can hear is the sound of the wind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I can feel is the breath of spring.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hey... where did you both go?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Me, all by myself... I don't want that...<PG>
Realizing I'm alone, I sink to my knees right there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No... not having you two here, I hate it...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I did get to come to a new world...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "33" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This landscape of cherry blossoms crumbles away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In an instant, everything around me is wrapped in darkness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
See... look. A world without you two is a world like this...<PG>
What a new world needs is <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No matter how much the cherry blossoms bloom... I don't want a world like that...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come back... Don't leave me alone...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ah ha ha ha! You're the same idiot as ever, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE> bright laughter rings out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Where!? Where are you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\幻想的な桜土手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花入院3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "14" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"See, I'm right here, aren't I?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Just like I thought, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> are still half-asleep. Getting giddy over spring is fine, but don't go spacing out!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... I'm so glad... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Hey, don't leave me ever again..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... I can't move my body. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But I was by your side the whole time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. Do you know why?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's because you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, were by my side the whole time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That's why I got through 2 years without ever feeling lonely."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... So you did know, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Of course I did!? With you chattering that loud in my room every single day, I'd hear it whether I wanted to or not..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Was I loud...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Super loud! Especially on the days </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> came too, it was crazy!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But... that's why every day was fun. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> guys' voices―hearing them was what I looked forward to every day."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see... then I'm glad. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Oh, hey, where's </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... come on. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">She went back to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">her own</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> house because three people can't stay over in a hospital room, remember?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> probably pretty worn out too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> make sure you don't wreck your body any more than this, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But... if I come less, won't you be bored, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's fine now too. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> don't have a single thing to worry about when it comes to me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you've stayed asleep all this time..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔前逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\肉付き\春花の手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "250" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> puts her hand on my <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ほお">cheek</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A warm hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can truly feel that <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> is alive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the surroundings gradually grow brighter.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "$80FFFF" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"It's about dawn. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, it's about time you woke up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wait...! Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> will... again...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"My hand's warm, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah... very..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm going to keep this hand on </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> the whole time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So don't worry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Keep it on me...?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "14" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―And here my dream ends.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Back to the real world again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wrapped in the warmth of a warm hand―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"―Mm..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Beyond my closed eyelids, I feel the sunlight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I open these eyes, I'll wake from the dream completely.<PG>
My neck hurts a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seems I fell asleep slumped over <STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE> bed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is the warmth of <STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE> hand... going to disappear too...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\春花病室昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But even when I sit up, the warmth of <STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE> hand doesn't fade.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Awake from the dream, with the real world leaping into my eyes, it stays warm.
