<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> is... gazing at me, her hand resting on me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE> faltering smile was more dazzling than any smile she'd ever given.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That dazzling smile―became the sun of the new world, lighting up everything around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was the world I'd been searching for.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A world with <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> in it.<PG>
Gradually things get noisy around us, and doctors and nurses start examining <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> in a flurry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But maybe because of that completely unexpected awakening, they're comically clumsy about it.<PG>
But we can't make out any of the sights or sounds.
