<BR>
If so, then even that frenzy of <STYLE ID="3">Haruka's</STYLE> wasn't all bad.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's truly what you might call turning misfortune into a blessing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> eye has stayed green all along, hasn't it..."</STYLE>
